# ==============================================================================
# QR Code Platform - Environment Variables (QR-P0.1 Public Website Stage)
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: QR-P0.1 is the public marketing & product foundation phase.
# Backend databases (Postgres/Redis/ClickHouse), S3 storage, authentication,
# and billing infrastructure will be introduced in subsequent milestones.
